# Windows production artifact candidates (ADR 0017). Supervisor and helper
# closures are built only into task-owned temporary directories, never into the
# repository, and no generated binary, manifest, or packaging result is ever
# tracked. These patterns exist so an accidental in-tree build stays untracked.
publish/
**/publish/
artifact-manifest.json
packaging-result.json
*.nupkg
*.pdb
